p("- Method: a clamp at 0 or a cap at regime max binds when the applied points are smaller in magnitude than the nominal magnitude. Exact only where the label carries that mutation alone (squeeze, decel, stall, CVD divergence, spread, Pass 2c, trend structure, funding). The funding nominal comes from the breakdown note text (`STEP3:` / `STEP3b:` flags).")
